From 1da1accc33cecb3ce4fc2be77f0406811854985a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:13:10 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed player icons

Replaces the remaining stock player icons (stop, skip forward, repeat, shuffle, mute, record, snapshot, info, chevrons, bookmark) with the design's, and hides the column divider in the audio-only tracks popup.
